00:35:11.310 --> 00:35:13.390
Randy said that the guns were dummy guns.

734
00:35:13.410 --> 00:35:19.950
They held no ammunition and they put all the sound effects and the muzzle flashes in during post-production.

735
00:35:20.530 --> 00:35:25.150
I watched that scene knowing that it was done in post-production and I kind of couldn't believe it.

736
00:35:25.270 --> 00:35:29.390
That is wild because you could see Steve as Michael kind of flinching, you know?

737
00:35:29.670 --> 00:35:30.210
I know.

738
00:35:30.350 --> 00:35:31.190
He did the kickback.

739
00:35:31.370 --> 00:35:33.150
That's some good fakey kickback acting.

740
00:35:33.290 --> 00:35:34.030
It really was.

741
00:35:34.990 --> 00:35:41.310
We also had a fan question from Madhu P in Toronto, Canada, who says,

